os Angeles Dodgers. The first sign of Cuba’s weakness was shown in the round-robin play. The Dutch team upset the Cubans 4-2, with a 3-RBI double by former Major League player " [:a {:href "/athletes/82574"} "Hensley Meulens"] " accounting for Cuba’s first ever Olympic defeat."] "\n\n" [:p {} "The final game saw the USA play Cuba, with " [:a {:href "/athletes/89749"} "Ben Sheets"] " pitching for the Americans.  He threw a 3-hit complete game shutout, and the United States won, 4-0.  Lasorda, who had managed two World Series’ champions with the Dodgers, later commented that nothing could compare to winning an Olympic gold medal."] "\n"] [:button {:id "button43133", :class "btn btn-default"} "Details"] [:script {} "$('#button43133').click(splits)"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {}] [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Team"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Wins/At Bats"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Losses/Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Points/Hits"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs For/Doubles"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Against/Triples"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Home Runs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "RBIs"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Walks"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Strikeouts"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Stolen Bases/Caught Stealing"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Sacrifice Hits/Sacrifice Flies"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Batting Average"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Won/Lost/Saves"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Innings Pitched"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Hits Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "display: none", :class "split"} "Earned Runs Allowed"] [:th {:style "displ